{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12100","headline":"卢龙塞行送韦掌记 · 钱起","name":"卢龙塞行送韦掌记","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨雪纷纷黑山外，行人共指卢龙塞。\n万里飞沙咽鼓鼙，三军杀气凝旌斾。\n陈琳书记本翩翩，料敌张兵夺酒泉。\n圣主好文兼好武，封侯莫比汉皇年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12100.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12100","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}